usage: check_actual_p4_receipt.py [-h] --artifact-zip ARTIFACT_ZIP
                                  [--run-json RUN_JSON]
                                  [--jobs-json JOBS_JSON]
                                  [--artifacts-json ARTIFACTS_JSON]
                                  [--artifact-id ARTIFACT_ID] --repo REPO
                                  [--dependency-repo NAME=PATH] --output-dir
                                  OUTPUT_DIR

Offline review of an ACTUAL Part 4 artifact at fixed 1089a965. Reads an
original artifact ZIP without extraction, GitHub REST metadata, and local
fixed git objects. No network, Lean, Lake, replay, CI, or fixtures. Writes
derivatives only below this receipt-prep directory. Never creates a synthetic
successful receipt. Missing evidence remains INCOMPLETE.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --artifact-zip ARTIFACT_ZIP
  --run-json RUN_JSON
  --jobs-json JOBS_JSON
  --artifacts-json ARTIFACTS_JSON
  --artifact-id ARTIFACT_ID
  --repo REPO           Local project git object database containing fixed
                        1089a965; HEAD is not changed.
  --dependency-repo NAME=PATH
                        Explicit local git database containing the existing
                        pinned dependency commit. Repeat as needed.
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        New, nonexisting result directory below this receipt-
                        prep directory.
